{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_17561","headline":"晚夏登张仪楼呈院中诸公 · 段文昌","name":"晚夏登张仪楼呈院中诸公","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"重楼窗户开，四望敛烟埃。\n远岫林端出，清波城下回。\n乍疑蝉韵促，稍觉雪风来。\n并起乡关思，销忧在酒杯。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"段文昌","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_17561.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_17561","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}